<title>UK: Ontario sets 10 billion yen three-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ontario sets 10 billion yen three-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ONTARIO</p>
<p> AMT    10 BLN YEN    COUPON     5.15	MATURITY    18.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    18.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.5	 REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	 =</p>
<p> NOTES	REDEMPTION IN US DOLLARS.</p>
<p> LISTING    UNLISTED     DENOMS (K) 500     SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
